; Journal for test/regress/timelog-tab-separator.test.  A TAB, not a
; space, separates the time from the account on the check-in line.  It
; cannot be the inline journal of a .test file: the Lean oracle that
; test/semantic/check_all.py runs splits clock lines on spaces only and
; rejects this line, and check_all.py fails on any inline positive
; journal that the oracle cannot read.

i 2024/01/18 09:00:00	Epsilon  Tab payee  ; tabbed
o 2024/01/18 10:00:00
